{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 0.92, "end_time_s": 6.28, "duration_s": 5.36, "text": "La nuit est si calme ce soir. On dirait que le monde entier a cessé de tourner, non ?", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 6.48, "end_time_s": 25.62, "duration_s": 19.14, "text": "Absolument. C'est parfait pour réfléchir. Je me demande si nous sommes juste des observateurs ou si nous influençons vraiment ce qui nous arrive.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 25.32, "end_time_s": 31.19, "duration_s": 5.87, "text": "Attends, je pensais à quelque chose de plus physique. Si le temps est une illusion, pourquoi notre peau vieillit ?", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 31.66, "end_time_s": 41.85, "duration_s": 10.19, "text": "C'est intéressant. Tu parles de l'erythroderma, cette rougeur persistante. Est-ce que c'est la preuve que nous ressentons vraiment, ou juste une réaction chimique ?", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 41.38, "end_time_s": 48.52, "duration_s": 7.14, "text": "Peut-être les deux. Comme quand on frotte une branche contre un autre morceau de bois pour créer du feu. Le bowdrill, tu vois ?", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 48.96, "end_time_s": 81.71, "duration_s": 32.75, "text": "Ah, la technique ancienne. La friction constante crée la chaleur, puis la fumée, puis la flamme. Comme nos pensées qui s'accumulent jusqu'à l'éclair de compréhension.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 81.14, "end_time_s": 87.38, "duration_s": 6.24, "text": "Mais est-ce que la flamme appartient à la branche ou au bois ? Ou est-ce qu'elle n'existe que dans l'instant même où elles se touchent ?", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 87.83, "end_time_s": 101.02, "duration_s": 13.19, "text": "C'est une belle image. Mais regarde les détails. Chaque grain de poussière dans la lumière de la lune a une histoire. C'est presque bezaleelian dans sa complexité architecturale.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 101.54, "end_time_s": 110.17, "duration_s": 8.63, "text": "Bezaleel, le constructeur du tabernacle. Il voyait le divin dans le matériel. Tu crois que nous construisons notre réalité de la même manière ?", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 110.35, "end_time_s": 126.16, "duration_s": 15.81, "text": "Je pense que nous choisissons quelles briques poser. Le bowdrill tourne, mais c'est notre main qui le guide. La vitesse, la pression...", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 126.35, "end_time_s": 132.08, "duration_s": 5.73, "text": "Et si la main se fatigue ? Si l'erythroderma nous signale que nous avons trop insisté, trop brûlé ?", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 132.57, "end_time_s": 142.51, "duration_s": 9.94, "text": "Alors on s'arrête. On observe la fumée monter. C'est dans ce silence que Bezaleel a peut-être trouvé ses modèles. Dans le vide laissé par l'action.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 142.8, "end_time_s": 148.28, "duration_s": 5.48, "text": "Je me sens légère ce soir. Comme si je flottais au-dessus de cette discussion. Et toi ?", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 148.5, "end_time_s": 175.64, "duration_s": 27.14, "text": "Moi, je me sens ancré. Le bois est solide sous mes pieds. Mais je comprends ton vol.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 175.81, "end_time_s": 187.65, "duration_s": 11.84, "text": "La nuit tombe vite, n'est-ce pas ? On dirait que le temps a accéléré, comme s'il voulait nous rattraper.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 175.95, "end_time_s": 180.69, "duration_s": 4.74, "text": "C'est étrange. Plus je réfléchis, plus je me sens petite. Mais pas seule.", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 181.05, "end_time_s": 189.87, "duration_s": 8.82, "text": "Exactement. La fumée du bowdrill se dissipe dans l'air, mais elle fait partie du ciel. Nous faisons partie du tout.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 188.22, "end_time_s": 193.93, "duration_s": 5.71, "text": "Oui, c'est étrange. Cette lumière bleue qui filtre par la fenêtre... elle donne l'impression que le monde s'est arrêté.", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 190.21, "end_time_s": 193.08, "duration_s": 2.87, "text": "Tu as remarqué comme le silence est plus dense ce soir ?", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 193.37, "end_time_s": 199.43, "duration_s": 6.06, "text": "Le soleil va bientôt se lever. La magie bezaleelian va devoir laisser place à la routine.", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 199.83, "end_time_s": 205.77, "duration_s": 5.94, "text": "Oui, on dirait que le temps s'est arrêté. Je pense à cette expérience de la vrille.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 206.07, "end_time_s": 217.7, "duration_s": 11.63, "text": "Peut-être. Mais la flamme reste en nous. On l'a juste éteinte pour ce soir.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 217.28, "end_time_s": 220.22, "duration_s": 2.94, "text": "La vrille ? Tu veux dire le vrillage de l'hélice ?", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 217.87, "end_time_s": 235.98, "duration_s": 18.11, "text": "Tu te souviens de cette discussion sur la mémoire ? Comment chaque souvenir semble être une version légèrement altérée de la réalité.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 220.72, "end_time_s": 224.85, "duration_s": 4.13, "text": "Oui. Dormons, et laissons la friction faire son œuvre pendant notre sommeil.", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 225.16, "end_time_s": 233.07, "duration_s": 7.91, "text": "Non, je parle du bois de la vrille. Ce frottement lent qui crée de la chaleur et de la fumée sans flamme apparente.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 233.56, "end_time_s": 238.4, "duration_s": 4.84, "text": "Bonne nuit. Que tes rêves soient aussi clairs que la cendre blanche.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 236.58, "end_time_s": 242.88, "duration_s": 6.3, "text": "J'y pense souvent. C'est comme si on revisitait un film, mais avec un script différent à chaque fois.", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 238.58, "end_time_s": 244.43, "duration_s": 5.85, "text": "C'est fascinant. C'est comme notre réflexion ici, on frotte nos idées l'une contre l'autre.", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 243.4, "end_time_s": 256.78, "duration_s": 13.38, "text": "Exactement. Et si cette version altérée était plus vraie que l'original ?", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 244.68, "end_time_s": 247.62, "duration_s": 2.94, "text": "Bonne nuit. Merci pour cette contemplation.", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 247.93, "end_time_s": 254.88, "duration_s": 6.95, "text": "Exactement. Et parfois, juste avant que l'étincelle ne jaillisse, il y a cette odeur de brûlé.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 255.23, "end_time_s": 260.25, "duration_s": 5.02, "text": "Une odeur de passé qui s'enflamme. Comme quand on se souvient d'un été lointain.", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 256.97, "end_time_s": 265.08, "duration_s": 8.11, "text": "C'est une idée fascinante, mais aussi inquiétante. Si tout est interprétation, alors la vérité n'existe plus.", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 260.62, "end_time_s": 267.41, "duration_s": 6.79, "text": "Je pense à cette maladie de peau, l'érythroderme. Le corps entier devient rouge, sensible.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 265.59, "end_time_s": 274.57, "duration_s": 8.98, "text": "Sauf peut-être dans les moments où on ne pense pas. Ces instants de silence où l'être précède le savoir.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 267.9, "end_time_s": 273.19, "duration_s": 5.29, "text": "Comme si la peau était devenue une mémoire trop vivante, incapable de cacher ce qu'elle ressent.", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 273.57, "end_time_s": 279.92, "duration_s": 6.35, "text": "Oui, une exposition totale à l'existence. On ne peut plus se cacher derrière une armure.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 275.13, "end_time_s": 279.34, "duration_s": 4.21, "text": "Comme cette sensation de vide qui nous entoure en ce moment. Elle est presque tangible.", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 279.68, "end_time_s": 295.18, "duration_s": 15.5, "text": "Oui, et elle me rappelle quelque chose... une idée que j'ai lue il y a longtemps. Bezaleelian, peut-être ?", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 280.38, "end_time_s": 283.56, "duration_s": 3.18, "text": "Et nous sommes nus dans ce silence. Qu'est-ce que ça dit de nous ?", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 284.06, "end_time_s": 289.05, "duration_s": 4.99, "text": "Peut-être que nous sommes tous des artisans, dans le sens bézéléen du terme.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 289.57, "end_time_s": 293.44, "duration_s": 3.87, "text": "Bézéléen... Comme Bezalel ? Le bâtisseur du Tabernacle ?", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 293.16, "end_time_s": 298.17, "duration_s": 5.01, "text": "Oui, celui qui a reçu l'esprit de Dieu pour créer l'art sacré.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 295.78, "end_time_s": 300.63, "duration_s": 4.85, "text": "Bezaleelian ? C'est un mot que je n'ai jamais entendu. Qu'est-ce que cela signifie ?", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 298.75, "end_time_s": 304.02, "duration_s": 5.27, "text": "Donc, en parlant, on tisse quelque chose ? On construit un sanctuaire éphémère ?", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 304.33, "end_time_s": 311.59, "duration_s": 7.26, "text": "Si la vrille produit du feu, et l'érythroderme produit de la sensibilité, alors le bézéléen produit le sens.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 312.02, "end_time_s": 316.88, "duration_s": 4.86, "text": "Tu as remarqué comment le silence ici est presque palpable, comme si le temps s'était arrêté ?", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 317.23, "end_time_s": 320.42, "duration_s": 3.19, "text": "C'est beau. Je crois que le sanctuaire est presque fini.", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 320.21, "end_time_s": 330.71, "duration_s": 10.5, "text": "Oui, c'est étrange. J'ai l'impression que chaque pensée résonne plus fort qu'elle ne le devrait.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 330.18, "end_time_s": 335.39, "duration_s": 5.21, "text": "Alors laissons la fumée monter. Le feu s'éteindra, mais la chaleur restera.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 330.97, "end_time_s": 353.16, "duration_s": 22.19, "text": "Je ne suis pas sûr. C'est comme une référence à une époque où l'art et l'artisanat étaient unis. Une sorte de pureté perdue.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 335.02, "end_time_s": 341.45, "duration_s": 6.43, "text": "Attends, je me souviens de cette théorie sur la friction... comme quand on utilise un bowdrill pour créer du feu.", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 341.81, "end_time_s": 350.85, "duration_s": 9.04, "text": "Exactement. Le mouvement constant, lent et régulier, génère de la chaleur. Est-ce que nos souvenirs fonctionnent pareil ?", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 350.42, "end_time_s": 358.55, "duration_s": 8.13, "text": "Peut-être. Mais parfois, la friction est trop forte et la peau devient érythrodème, rouge et irritée par le frottement incessant.", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 353.51, "end_time_s": 358.13, "duration_s": 4.62, "text": "Intéressant. Peut-être que notre quête de vérité est aussi une quête de cette pureté.", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 358.97, "end_time_s": 361.82, "duration_s": 2.85, "text": "Comme si on insistait trop longtemps sur un moment précis.", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 362.41, "end_time_s": 382.84, "duration_s": 20.43, "text": "Et si on ne peut pas tout retenir, est-ce qu'on est vraiment nous-mêmes ? Ou juste une collection de fragments ?", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 382.51, "end_time_s": 390.44, "duration_s": 7.93, "text": "Une collection bezaleélienne, peut-être. Chaque pièce a sa place, mais l'ensemble change selon qui regarde.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 383.05, "end_time_s": 391.96, "duration_s": 8.91, "text": "Oui, et peut-être que nous la trouvons dans les pauses, entre deux mots.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 390.59, "end_time_s": 395.79, "duration_s": 5.2, "text": "J'aime cette idée. Que l'identité soit un assemblage, pas une essence fixe.", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 392.26, "end_time_s": 396.23, "duration_s": 3.97, "text": "Comme maintenant. Ce silence qui nous relie, malgré la distance.", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 396.27, "end_time_s": 399.82, "duration_s": 3.55, "text": "Donc, si je change de perspective, je deviens quelqu'un d'autre ?", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 400.21, "end_time_s": 404.8, "duration_s": 4.59, "text": "Pas quelqu'un d'autre. Juste une version différente de toi-même.", "speaker_position": [2.06, 1.8, 1.17], "speaker_size": 0.28}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 405.02, "end_time_s": 417.4, "duration_s": 12.38, "text": "Et dans ce silence, on peut enfin entendre ces versions.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 416.96, "end_time_s": 419.24, "duration_s": 2.28, "text": "Oui. Et peut-être que c'est suffisant.", "speaker_position": [1.43, 3.69, 1.24], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 417.73, "end_time_s": 427.49, "duration_s": 9.76, "text": "Exactement. Et dans ce silence, tout devient possible.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 427.7, "end_time_s": 432.5, "duration_s": 4.8, "text": "Alors, reste avec moi dans ce silence. Avant que le temps ne reprenne son cours.", "speaker_position": [3.45, 2.99, 1.66], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 433.02, "end_time_s": 447.15, "duration_s": 14.13, "text": "D'accord. Je reste. Juste un instant de plus.", "speaker_position": [2.98, 1.68, 1.15], "speaker_size": 0.38}
